        <item>
            <title>1.3.3</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 18:17:55 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Overhead 1.3.3</h3><ul>
<li>Helicopters now show as helicopters, on the map and in the sidebar: rotor and tail, pointing the way they are going</li>
<li>Aircraft sitting at airports are hidden by default, since they are not overhead. Bring them back from the filter menu</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
